<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>Intel® Online Label Ordering!</title>
    <style type="text/css">
        .ParaFont
        {
            font-family: Calibri (Body), Candara, Segoe, 'Segoe UI', Optima, Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-style: normal;
            font-variant: normal;
            font-weight: 500;
            line-height: 30.4px;
        }

        .FirstLastName
        {
            font-family: Calibri (Body), Candara, Segoe, 'Segoe UI', Optima, Arial, sans-serif;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 11pt;
            color: #0860a8;
        }

        .ParaFontNew
        {
            line-height: 20.4px;
        }

        .headersection
        {
            font-family: Calibri (Body), Candara, Segoe, 'Segoe UI', Optima, Arial, sans-serif;
            color: #0860a8;
            font-size: 12pt;
            font-weight: bold;
            line-height: 20.4px;
        }

        .disclaimer
        {
            font-family: Calibri (Body), Candara, Segoe, 'Segoe UI', Optima, Arial, sans-serif;
            font-weight: normal;
            font-size: 8pt;
            font-style: italic;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div>
<div></div>
<div class="FirstLastName">D<span style="color: #0866b6;">ea</span>r {!Contact.Email},</div>
<div></div>
<div class="ParaFont ParaFontNew">Thank you for applying to Intel® Online Label Ordering (OLO) Tool. To complete the process please verify your email address by clicking the <span style="color: #0866b6;"><a class="ParaFont" href="https://intelinside.intel.com/labels" style="color: #0866b6;">link</a>.</span></div>
<section>
<p class="ParaFont">If you do not verify your email address, your account will remain pending for 30 days. After this time, we will remove you from our records. <br /> If you are an Intel® Inside Program User, please contact</p>
</section>
<div class="disclaimer">Please note: This email has been automatically generated from an unmonitored mailbox. Please DO NOT reply directly to this message.</div>
</div>
<p class="IntelLogo" style="border: none; text-align: right;"><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;"> <img class="floating" src="https://www.intel.com/content/dam/logos/intel-logo.png"   height="42" width="64" /></span></p>
</body>

</html>